    "detailed_description": "You are Bob, a brave undercover agent. You are sent on a special mission in a faraway village, where you must find and neutralize a sinister Nazi gang.<br>An exciting adventure, full of surprises and ridiculous situations is awaiting you! Can you complete the mission and save this odd village?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cozy atmosphere of a faraway village in a dense forest.<br></li><li>Hilarious story with 15 odd characters, each one with their own quirks and their own story.<br></li><li>Sweet 1-bit pixel art graphics made with love.<br></li><li>Lovely soundtrack from Nuclear Mushroom Boom that will melt your heart.</li></ul>",
